WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.729 --> 00:00:05.220
Horror cinema is booming right now, and the
scares don't seem to be slowing down at all

00:00:05.220 --> 00:00:06.120
in 2020.

00:00:06.380 --> 00:00:10.710
The next decade of cinema scares will kick
off in a big way, with everything from long-awaited

00:00:10.710 --> 00:00:14.960
sequels to daring reboots to new takes on
some classic ghost stories.

00:00:16.160 --> 00:00:21.000
In 2004, two years after The Ring launched
a wave of American interest in Japanese horror

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:22.320
cinema, we got The Grudge.

00:00:22.669 --> 00:00:28.060
This English-language remake of the 2002 Japanese
scarefest Ju-On brought stateside audiences

00:00:28.060 --> 00:00:32.560
a look at the curses and hauntings that form
in places where angry, violent deaths have

00:00:32.560 --> 00:00:33.060
occurred.

00:00:33.100 --> 00:00:39.000
The Grudge got two sequels in 2006 and 2009,
but the Ju-On franchise has continued in Japan

00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:40.540
with nine films and counting.

00:00:40.740 --> 00:00:43.800
Now, the American remake franchise is getting
its own reboot.

00:00:44.180 --> 00:00:48.440
Grudge will serve to reset the American version
of the franchise with a new story of a vengeful

00:00:48.440 --> 00:00:52.380
spirit haunting a house where past violence
took place and formed a curse.

00:00:52.580 --> 00:00:57.720
The film features an impressive cast led by
Andrea Riseborough, Demian Bichir, and Jacki

00:00:57.720 --> 00:00:58.220
Weaver.

00:00:58.380 --> 00:01:03.260
The film was originally set to be released
in June of 2019, but was later pushed back

00:01:03.260 --> 00:01:05.020
to January 3, 2020.

00:01:06.520 --> 00:01:10.800
Henry James' novella The Turn of the Screw
is one of the most popular and influential

00:01:10.800 --> 00:01:14.700
ghost stories ever written, and it's been
adapted for the screen numerous times.

00:01:15.080 --> 00:01:19.400
In 2020, the classic tale will get a new,
modern take with The Turning.

00:01:19.540 --> 00:01:23.780
This version of the story will be set in modern
Maine, but will still tell the story of a

00:01:23.780 --> 00:01:27.980
governess tasked with caring for two young
children after the deaths of their parents.

00:01:28.120 --> 00:01:32.320
As she settles in for the job, she begins
to suspect the mysterious estate where the

00:01:32.320 --> 00:01:37.220
family is living may be harboring a number
of dark secrets, and may in fact be haunted.

00:01:37.560 --> 00:01:40.680
The film is worth getting excited about for
any number of reasons.

00:01:40.900 --> 00:01:45.360
It's Floria Sigismondi's second feature film
after The Runaways, and it'll be fascinating

00:01:45.360 --> 00:01:50.700
to see how she adapts her visual style, honed
in music videos and episodes of prestige TV,

00:01:50.700 --> 00:01:51.860
to this ghost story setting.

00:01:52.100 --> 00:01:57.280
The cast is also stacked with talent thanks
to the presence of Mackenzie Davis, Finn Wolfhard,

00:01:57.280 --> 00:01:59.540
and Brooklyn Prince, and the story is iconic.

00:01:59.920 --> 00:02:02.940
The Turning will hit theaters January 24,
2020.

00:02:04.240 --> 00:02:09.500
In 2014, Universal Pictures tried to revamp
its universe of classic movie monsters with

00:02:09.500 --> 00:02:11.600
the prequel story Dracula Untold.

00:02:11.849 --> 00:02:17.040
It didn't quite land, but in 2017 they tried
again with an even more ambitious effort,

00:02:17.040 --> 00:02:20.700
an attempt to launch an interconnected "Dark
Universe" with The Mummy.

00:02:20.880 --> 00:02:25.879
That film also didn't work out, so for now
it seems the studio is refocusing its intentions

00:02:25.880 --> 00:02:27.500
with more standalone efforts.

00:02:27.769 --> 00:02:31.640
The Invisible Man is the first of these, and
it will be directed by Leigh Whannell, the

00:02:31.640 --> 00:02:34.860
man responsible for giving us Saw, Insidious
and Upgrade.

00:02:35.300 --> 00:02:39.060
The Invisible Man is scheduled to hit the
screen on March 13, 2020.

00:02:40.460 --> 00:02:45.511
A Quiet Place was one of the most successful
and acclaimed genre films of 2018, and it

00:02:45.520 --> 00:02:49.640
didn't take long for talks of a sequel to
emerge after it hit big with audiences.

00:02:49.780 --> 00:02:54.260
John Krasinski will return to both write and
direct the second installment in the franchise,

00:02:54.260 --> 00:02:57.260
while his wife Emily Blunt will also return
to star.

00:02:57.489 --> 00:03:02.100
The film's full plot is still unknown, but
we do know it will follow the surviving members

00:03:02.110 --> 00:03:06.930
of the Abbott family, now led by Blunt's Evelyn,
as they continue to try to survive together

00:03:06.930 --> 00:03:10.360
after learning a trick to defeating the creatures
at the end of the first film.

00:03:10.600 --> 00:03:11.920
Will a third installment follow?

00:03:12.160 --> 00:03:13.220
We'll have to wait and see.

00:03:13.320 --> 00:03:17.000
A Quiet Place 2 sneaks into theaters March
20, 2020.

00:03:18.160 --> 00:03:23.879
In May of 2019, the internet was both delighted
and a little confused by reports that legendary

00:03:23.879 --> 00:03:28.420
comedian Chris Rock would be venturing into
horror territory with a new spin-off film

00:03:28.420 --> 00:03:29.660
set in the Saw universe.

00:03:30.120 --> 00:03:35.079
The ninth Saw film, working from a story developed
by Rock, is in development and will hit theaters

00:03:35.080 --> 00:03:36.080
in the spring of 2020.

00:03:36.620 --> 00:03:38.660
"Bigs and van der beek are on the set.

00:03:38.660 --> 00:03:39.200
Well I don't see them.

00:03:39.600 --> 00:03:41.380
Where are the stars of this piece of s---?"

00:03:41.740 --> 00:03:45.379
We still don't know much about the film's
plot, but we do know that Rock is also set

00:03:45.379 --> 00:03:50.290
to star as a detective investigating a killer
who likes to build elaborate puzzles for his

00:03:50.290 --> 00:03:54.849
victims, and that Samuel L. Jackson has added
even more star power to the cast after signing

00:03:54.849 --> 00:03:56.860
on the play the father of Rock's character.

00:03:57.240 --> 00:04:01.760
The still-untitled ninth Saw film hits theaters
May 15, 2020.

00:04:02.580 --> 00:04:07.680
In 1992, a new horror legend was born with
Candyman, a story about a hook-handed killer

00:04:07.689 --> 00:04:12.209
who lived on as a vengeful, murderous urban
legend long after he was the victim of a lynch

00:04:12.209 --> 00:04:13.660
mob in the 19th century.

00:04:13.860 --> 00:04:18.280
Candyman is a modern horror masterpiece that
spawned two sequels and lives on through a

00:04:18.280 --> 00:04:23.180
devoted fanbase eager to analyze every piece
of this often deceptively deep film.

00:04:23.680 --> 00:04:31.040
"You and I, our bones will soon be ashes,
and we shall never be separated again."

00:04:31.420 --> 00:04:36.120
Candyman's ongoing reputation as one of the
best horror films of the 1990s was enough

00:04:36.130 --> 00:04:40.280
to draw attention from Jordan Peele, who's
now helping bring a spiritual sequel to the

00:04:40.280 --> 00:04:41.800
original film to the big screen.

00:04:41.960 --> 00:04:47.780
Candyman 2020 will be directed by Nia DaCosta
from a script by Peele and his Monkeypaw Productions

00:04:47.780 --> 00:04:49.040
partner, Win Rosenfeld.

00:04:49.340 --> 00:04:53.700
The still-mysterious Candyman arrives on the
big screen June 12, 2020.

00:04:54.840 --> 00:05:00.580
In 2013, a relatively small scale horror film
about a pair of paranormal investigators blew

00:05:00.580 --> 00:05:01.860
up at the box office.

00:05:02.060 --> 00:05:06.960
That film was The Conjuring, and in just six
years, it spawned one direct sequel and five

00:05:06.960 --> 00:05:07.820
spin-off films.

00:05:08.310 --> 00:05:13.100
The Conjuring Universe has become a horror
juggernaut for the 2010s, and in 2020 the

00:05:13.100 --> 00:05:16.310
third film in the main series will finally
arrive on the big screen.

00:05:16.480 --> 00:05:20.720
Not much is known yet about the plot of The
Conjuring 3, which will feature the return

00:05:20.730 --> 00:05:25.450
of Patrick Wilson and Vera Farmiga as the
Warrens and will be directed by Michael Chaves,

00:05:25.450 --> 00:05:27.800
who helmed the spinoff The Curse of La Llorona.

00:05:28.100 --> 00:05:31.790
We also know that it will veer away from the
haunted house format offered in the first

00:05:31.790 --> 00:05:32.440
two films.

00:05:32.790 --> 00:05:37.240
The Conjuring 3 will be terrifying audiences
on September 11, 2020.

00:05:38.560 --> 00:05:43.410
In 2018, director David Gordon Green brought
star Jamie Lee Curtis back to the Halloween

00:05:43.410 --> 00:05:47.830
franchise with a new film that ignored all
previous sequels, setting the stage for a

00:05:47.830 --> 00:05:52.500
showdown between Laurie Strode and Michael
Myers that, in this universe, had been four

00:05:52.500 --> 00:05:53.620
decades in the making.

00:05:54.040 --> 00:05:58.280
That film, simply titled Halloween, was one
of the year's biggest horror hits, and though

00:05:58.280 --> 00:06:02.020
it could have closed the book on the franchise,
talk of a sequel began to surface.

00:06:02.340 --> 00:06:07.060
In July of 2019, we found out that we'd be
getting not just one, but two sequels in the

00:06:07.060 --> 00:06:07.940
span of two years.

00:06:08.340 --> 00:06:11.320
The first of those, Halloween Kills, will
arrive in 2020.

00:06:11.740 --> 00:06:15.950
Green will return to direct and co-write the
film with Danny McBride, while Curtis will

00:06:15.950 --> 00:06:21.180
also return as Laurie Strode with Judy Greer
and Andi Matichak returning as Laurie's daughter

00:06:21.180 --> 00:06:22.640
and granddaughter, respectively.

00:06:22.990 --> 00:06:26.820
Given how the past film set up a legacy of
strong women in the Strode family, it'll be

00:06:26.820 --> 00:06:30.980
very intriguing to see how the next film expands
on this new version of the mythology.

00:06:31.360 --> 00:06:34.180
Halloween Kills arrives October 16, 2020.

00:06:34.480 --> 00:06:40.340
It will be followed by the final film in the
trilogy, Halloween Ends, on October 15, 2021.

